# oracle: fix smd/wall_surface (native STL reader: ASCII facets become wall atoms at the triangle centroids) with water ulsph, examples/PACKAGES/machdyn/funnel_flow cut down: the 369 facets of boundary.stl whose centroids lie in a 30 x 35 x 60 mm box around the funnel outlet (w100smd_funnel_wall_cut.stl instead of 9472 facets), water lattice 5 mm (96 water atoms instead of about 22000), 200 steps instead of 5000. The wall triangles are inert here (pair_coeff 1 2 none); w205ts_funnel_contact is the same system with the contact pair smd/tri_surface.
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): engine vs native thermo max rel 3.6e-15 (ke at step 160); final per-atom state (544 atoms, the 369 wall atoms included) identical to the last printed digit (max rel 0).
# oracle-inputs: w100smd_funnel_wall_cut.stl
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
####################################################################################################
# water in a funnel-like box with the STL wall atoms created by fix smd/wall_surface
####################################################################################################
variable        c0 equal 10.0
variable        rho equal 1.0e-6
variable        q1 equal 0.06
variable        cp equal 1.0
variable        hg equal 0.0
dimension       3
units           si
boundary        f f f
atom_style      smd
atom_modify     map array
comm_modify     vel yes
newton          off
variable        l0 equal 5.0
lattice         sc ${l0}
region          box block -40 40 -30 40 -30 30 units box
create_box      2 box
region          water block -10 10 -10 20 -10 10 units box
create_atoms    1 region water
group           water type 1
variable        h equal 2.01*${l0}
variable        vol_one equal ${l0}^3
variable        skin equal 0.1*${h}
neighbor        ${skin} bin
variable        cr equal ${l0}/2
set             group all smd/contact/radius ${cr}
set             group all volume ${vol_one}
set             group all smd/mass/density ${rho}
set             group all diameter ${h}
fix             gfix all gravity 0.01 vector 0.0 -1. 0.0
pair_style      hybrid/overlay smd/ulsph *DENSITY_CONTINUITY *VELOCITY_GRADIENT *NO_GRADIENT_CORRECTION
pair_coeff      1 1 smd/ulsph *COMMON ${rho} ${c0} ${q1} ${cp} ${hg} *EOS_TAIT 2 *END
pair_coeff      1 2 none
pair_coeff      2 2 none
fix             stl_surface_fix all smd/wall_surface w100smd_funnel_wall_cut.stl 2 65535
run             0
group           surface type 2
fix             dtfix all smd/adjust_dt 0.1
fix             integration_fix water smd/integrate_ulsph adjust_radius 1.01 10 15
thermo          20
thermo_style    custom step dt f_dtfix pe ke
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             200
